        "title": "Recognize Ollama Auth.js session cookies",
        "body": "## Summary\n- recognize current `authjs.session-token` cookies during Ollama session discovery\n- support secure and chunked Auth.js variants\n- retain all existing legacy NextAuth and Ollama cookie names\n\n## Proof\nThe focused tests pass both an unchunked `authjs.session-token` through browser-cookie selection and a chunked `__Secure-authjs.session-token.0` through manual-header validation. All 20 focused fetcher tests pass without reading a real browser or Keychain.\n\n## Tests\n- `swift test --disable-sandbox --filter OllamaUsageFetcherTests` (20 passed)\n- changed Swift files: SwiftFormat and SwiftLint strict passed\n- `git diff --check upstream/main...HEAD`\n\n## Reference\n- Auth.js current session cookie evidence: https://github.com/nextauthjs/next-auth/issues/11370\n\n## Commits\n- 3 focused commits: implementation, tests, documentation",
